Who did this project?      =>      Erdoğan Bulut/B221202021 - Yüksel Mert Kırdar/B221202077

Why we choose this concept?      =>      This concept is suitable for the limitations also it can be used from anyone.

How was the development process?

We decided on the theme of the page.
Then we designed some page ideas in paint.
After that, we chose one of them and tried to do that in HTML.
We designed the page logo and divided the page into pieces.
In the logo design process, we designed different logos for each page because we wanted the logos to be suitable for the page content.
If the page is about movies, then the logo includes movie characters. If it is anime, then the logo includes anime characters, etc.
Then we designed the middle of the page and created an image gallery.
At the beginning, we start with 10 images and set their positions.
Then we convert the images to buttons and add them to a shadow effect.
And this shadow effect is also our hover effect, but in hover, the color is different.
When we completed the image gallery, we decided to design navbar and add some buttons.
Those buttons can switch pages or show pop-ups about registration.
After setting the buttons, we designed those pop-up modals.
For the registration page, we create a script to display a pop-up when clicked on.
We used the same script for image buttons, and we added contents to these popups.
When we learn we need to use bootstrap, we set everything from the beginning and add sidebars to the body.
These sidebars include top lists and newly released video contents.
When we finished one of the pages, we adapted this design to the other pages.
For the main page, we wanted to do a different thing, so we decided to create a news page for the main page.
After we complete the main page, we add a contact panel at the bottom of the pages.
This contact panel includes copyright text and some social buttons.
When everything was completed, we decided what colors we needed to use for backgrounds and font colors.
We decided on a dark theme background and popups because, generally, a person who watches a movie, film, or anime wants to be in a dark place because that person wants to focus on what he or she is watching.

What are the duties of group members?
=> Erdoğan created homepage , animes page and login/sign up panel , wrote HTML , CSS , BOOTSTRAP and JAVASCRIPT codes and logos of website.​
=> Yüksel created movies and series pages and wrote HTML , CSS codes and presentation.

What is the subject of the site?      =>      The subject is informations about video contents.      =>      Our purpose is who is visiting our website he/she get knowledge about what he/she wants to watch.

What is deficiencies of our website?
This site can't store sign up inputs so there is no saved data for login part. They are just design blocks.
When the trailer opens, the trailer continues even if the pop-up is closed until it is manually stopped.